  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transport for emergency care for the elderly</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the war, one of the most vulnerable sections of Ukraine&apos;s population - lonely sick elderly people - became even more vulnerable. Many of them cannot move on their own and need constant assistance. In total, our foundation cares for more than 15,000 elderly people. Every week, we deliver food, medicine, personal care products, wheelchairs, household items and even furniture to the elderly. Our help can save many lives, so we need to act fast. So we really need help with delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
